<title>POLAND: NBP PARITY RATE -- USD/PLN 2.8001, DEM/PLN 1.8791.</title>
<headline>NBP PARITY RATE -- USD/PLN 2.8001, DEM/PLN 1.8791.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland said its dollar/zloty parity rate for September 3 was 2.8001, and its mark/zloty parity rate was 1.8791.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
